        "product_summary": "Rotary dial closure: A tongue-mounted dial routes a thin cord through paired webbing guides across the instep.\nMesh and synthetic upper: Mesh covers the forefoot and leaf-shaped side openings, bordered by stitched synthetic overlays.\nLow-cut collar: A padded mesh opening and rear pull loop complete the closed-heel casual walking profile.\nTPR outsole: The actual underside shows angular tread sections and curved channels below the contrasting grey sidewall.\nWholesale colour-size options: Black and Dark Grey are offered in EU 39–48 for a neutral-colour assortment.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
